      "forest": "森林",
      "friction_slows_wind_near_surface": "摩擦使近地面的风减速",
      "add_a_bird_to_ride_the_wind_currents": "添加一只鸟以乘着气流飞翔",
      "add_bird": "🐦 添加鸟",
