      "yes_evolution_covers_everything_from_n": "Yes — evolution covers everything from non-life to humans",
      "yes_evolution_proved_life_came_from_no": "Yes — evolution proved life came from non-life",
      "yes_life_is_constantly_improving_towar": "Yes — life is constantly improving toward greater complexity",
