      "drone_powerline_desc": "Real Part 107 work: fly low and slow along a 6-segment powerline, photograph each defect site for the utility crew, and return to launch. Tighter tolerance — 30 ft, 60 ft AGL, 5 kts.",
      "drone_survey_desc": "Fly a Part 107 drone survey of Casco Bay. Stay below 400 ft AGL, within visual line of sight, capture 4 photo waypoints, and return to launch.",
