      "tobias_frere_jones_erik_spiekermann_je": "Tobias Frere-Jones, Erik Spiekermann, Jessica Hische, Tracy Jenkins. They share work-in-progress sketches, talk about historical references, and post the kind of behind-the-scenes craft that schools rarely show.",
      "today_digital": "Today + digital",
      "too_much_antimony_makes_the_alloy_hard": "Too much antimony makes the alloy hard but brittle. Type chips or shatters under press pressure within a few impressions. Workshop disaster.",
